OL,3,GNEWSAGiant jellyfish with '40ft
OL,4,Atentacles' captured on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore commonly found in the colder
OL,7,Fwaters off Scotland, a marine biologist
OL,8,Fsaid although the lion's mane sting was
OL,9,F"nasty", it was not dangerous.
